<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In In-Context Learning Enhanced Credibility Transformer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Discussion and Conclusions</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In In-Context Learning Enhanced Credibility Transformer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
