</section>
<section id="S5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.3 </span>Regional Analysis</h3>

<div id="S5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As a preliminary introduction to better understand the performance of our zero-shot approach across different regions, we present a detailed breakdown of the results by region in Table <a href="#S5.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ 5.3 Regional Analysis ‣ 5 Zero-shot analysis using ICL ‣ In-Context Learning Enhanced Credibility Transformer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>. This table shows the claim counts, exposure, claim rates, and Poisson deviance for each region, along with whether it was designated as “unseen” and its assignment to the training or test set. The Poisson deviance has been calculated by using the average observed rates within each region as the predictions.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T5" class="ltx_table">
<table id="S5.T5.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S5.T5.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T5.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.45pt 4.0pt;"><span id="S5.T5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Region</span></td>
<td id="S5.T5.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.45pt 4.0pt;"><span id="S5.T5.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">ClaimNb</span></td>
<td id="S5.T5.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.45pt 4.0pt;"><span id="S5.T5.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Exposure</span></td>
<td id="S5.T5.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.45pt 4.0pt;"><span id="S5.T5.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Claim Rate</span></td>
<td id="S5.T5.2.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.45pt 4.0pt;"><span id="S5.T5.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Poisson Dev.</span></td>
