<section id="Ax1.SSx1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Narrative.</h5>

<div id="Ax1.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Already in phase1 (untrained) and in the pre–base model the nearest neighbors match the same A/R53 diesel B1 cohort with late‑60s drivers. Outcome decoration tightens proximity (best distance <math id="Ax1.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\approx 0.35\to 0.30" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.35</mn><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mn>0.30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\approx 0.35\to 0.30</annotation></semantics></math>) while preserving fuel/region/brand; the final stages broaden slightly but retain the same actuarial signature.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
