<section id="Ax1.SSx3.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Narrative.</h5>

<div id="Ax1.SSx3.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.SSx3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Across stages the closest neighbors are near duplicates in C/R24 with B2 diesel and ages 59–62. Decoration further tightens the best match (<math id="Ax1.SSx3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\approx 0.018\to 0.011" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.018</mn><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mn>0.011</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\approx 0.018\to 0.011</annotation></semantics></math>). Final stages admit slightly older matches (64–65, same fuel/region) but remain within the same credibility cluster.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
