<div id="Ax1.SSx4.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.SSx4.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This point has near-exact duplicates (distance <math id="Ax1.SSx4.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\approx 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\approx 0</annotation></semantics></math>) in D/R24 B1 diesel, and decoration leaves that structure intact. Final stages admit B3/B2 variants and slightly different ages, but the local cohort remains the same.</p>
</div>
