<section id="Ax1.SSx5.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Narrative.</h5>

<div id="Ax1.SSx5.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.SSx5.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A highly redundant C/R52 B1 diesel segment: phase1 through post–decorated return a literal near‑duplicate as the closest match. Final stages broaden gently into R53 with similar ages and power.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
