<section id="Ax1.SSx6.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Narrative.</h5>

<div id="Ax1.SSx6.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.SSx6.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Phase1 already centres on the C/R72 B2 diesel cohort in the mid‑40s. Decoration consistently tightens distances. Final stages broaden slightly to B1/B3 diesels in the same region (and occasional adjacent regions in deeper ranks), leaving the core profile unchanged.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
