<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Narrative.</h5>

<div id="Ax1.SSx7.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.SSx7.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A very stable E/R93 B6 Regular cluster: phase1 through post–decorated return practically the same neighbors (late‑50s/early‑60s). Final stages admit a few B6 diesel comparisons further down the list, but the area/region/fuel signature remains consistent.</p>
</div>
