<section id="Ax1.SSx8.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Narrative.</h5>

<div id="Ax1.SSx8.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.SSx8.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A clear E/R82 Regular cohort with ages in the low‑ to mid‑40s. Decoration reliably tightens the closest match. Post stages occasionally draw B5 Regulars (or B1 diesels farther down), but region and age alignment remain strong.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
