<section id="Ax1.SSx9.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Narrative.</h5>

<div id="Ax1.SSx9.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.SSx9.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The dominant pattern is E/R11 Regular B1 with early‑ to mid‑30s drivers. Decoration tightens substantially (best distance <math id="Ax1.SSx9.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\approx 0.32\to 0.21" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.32</mn><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mn>0.21</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\approx 0.32\to 0.21</annotation></semantics></math> pre; <math id="Ax1.SSx9.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\approx 0.28\to 0.21" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.28</mn><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mn>0.21</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\approx 0.28\to 0.21</annotation></semantics></math> post). Pre–final briefly explores B6 diesel (R72) and B5 Regular (R26), but post stages re‑centre on R11 Regular B1.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
